  "```lean\nSimpleGraph.IsAcyclic.{u} {V : Type u} (G : SimpleGraph V) : Prop\n```\n***\nA graph is *acyclic* (or a *forest*) if it has no cycles. \n***\n*import Mathlib.Combinatorics.SimpleGraph.Acyclic*",
  "definitionStartPos": {"line": 52, "column": 4},
